  "helpfulness_justification": "Northwind gains most from the permanent 8% S2 ceiling and the 72-month S3 retrofit, while Halcyon gains most from the discretionary recall in S5 and the 36-month suppression start in S4, so the net benefits are roughly balanced.",
  "conflict_styles": {
