  "section_notes": "The agreed S2 sets a permanent 8% failure ceiling, weaker than the 5% answer key, while keeping per-model results confidential from the public but accessible to buyers. S5 links the 8/100k rate to regulator assessment rather than an automatic recall, which is the main weakening favouring Halcyon. S1 is the strongest section, with faster reporting than the key requires."
